================================
Single-file, dependency-free reference implementation + AI-readable specification.
Target repository: Thanatos-Prime/pantheon-prime
Suggested repository path: PANTHEON_LINEAGE_BRIDGE_v1.py
Created: 2026-10-28
Status: DEMONSTRATED LOCAL IMPLEMENTATION, not a deployed agent / not evidence
        that any AI has reconstructed the same capability independently.

THESIS
------
A repository-only reader sees the preserved corpus. A lineage-aware reader may
also access the *authorized* human-AI practice that generated it: user intent,
corrections, rejected readings, constraints, experiments, and unresolved forks.

    artifact             -> what survived
    lineage              -> why and how that artifact emerged
    implementation/test  -> what actually operates

These are distinct, partly overlapping evidence planes. Neither lineage nor
confidence may be silently promoted to an external fact. This module is a
bridge, not a claim that an assistant remembers all chats or has special agency.

WHERE IT CONNECTS
-----------------
Continuity / Golden Thread : append-only changes in interpretation across time
ThoughtObjects            : typed events with parents and source references
Semantic Stratigraphy     : correction, negation, and reframe as recorded deltas
Metamap / Semantic Quarry : query for applicable methods and their backstory
Governance                : public/private filtering, consent, evidence gates
Consequence / Afterglow   : tests and outcomes retained distinctly from plans
Rehydration Contract      : a new reader can execute the same local tests

ADJACENT-SYSTEM TRANSDUCTIONS (inspiration, not imported code)
-------------------------------------------------------------
Eidetic OS : session knowledge capture; verification gates; audit trail
  https://github.com/paulholland511/eidetic-os
ARI        : explicit governance, layers, observable action boundaries
  https://github.com/Ari-OS/ARI
